id: GO-QUAL-023
title: Function too large
category: quality
severity: info
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .go
  exclude_paths: test/ vendor/ _test.go
patterns:
  - regex: ^func\s
    message: "Function detected — check length (>50 lines suggests decomposition needed)"
fix: Break large functions into smaller, focused functions. Aim for <50 lines per function.
